Cell["\<\
Simplify counter-terms (see top_SelfEnergy_CT.nb and top-Vertex_CT.nb):
(since we assume MT < mChi + MT, B1[MT^2] is always real)\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9920848319389877`*^9, 3.9920848422745333`*^9}, {
  3.992085054293433*^9, 3.9920851026695423`*^9}, {3.992329480821989*^9, 
